WEBVTT

00:15:28.627 --> 00:15:30.126
And then they finally got it.

00:15:32.038 --> 00:15:33.713
So where do we go from here?

00:15:35.022 --> 00:15:39.091
Well, we still have a ways to go
in terms of anti-discrimination.

00:15:39.115 --> 00:15:42.782
There are only 17 states
that have an anti-discrimination law

00:15:42.806 --> 00:15:45.382
against discrimination in housing,

00:15:45.406 --> 00:15:48.498
employment, public accommodation --

00:15:48.522 --> 00:15:51.510
only 17 states, and five of them
are in New England.

00:15:51.534 --> 00:15:53.435
We need less expensive drugs.

00:15:53.459 --> 00:15:54.846
They cost a fortune.

00:15:55.164 --> 00:15:59.057
And we need to get
this condition out of the DSM.

00:15:59.081 --> 00:16:03.781
It is as much a psychiatric disease
as being gay and lesbian,